From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Herman van Hazendonk <github.com@herrie.org>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 20:46:57 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Add unit tests for the log file modes and group

The logs are 0640 group adm: open() mode, umask at start and after a
rotation for a subscriber, setgid() to adm, the compressed rotations, and
what happens without an adm group or when setgid() fails.

The functions are static in main.c, so tests/log_file_shim.c includes
that file and replaces getgrnam(), setgid() and LSSubscriptionReply().
No test needs root or a real adm group. The tests are off by default;
build them with -DPMLOGDAEMON_BUILD_TESTS=ON. Nothing they build is
installed.

The shim joins the worker itself: WorkerRoutineDestruct() calls
g_thread_unref() after g_thread_join() has dropped the last reference.

Signed-off-by: Herman van Hazendonk <github.com@herrie.org>
Upstream-Status: Pending
